<title>POLAND: Zywiec Q2 net rises to PLN 11.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Zywiec Q2 net rises to PLN 11.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zywiec preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			21.35 vs	5.05</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  19.17 vs	3.42</p>
<p>    net profit				11.35 vs	1.51</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Zaklady Piwowarskie w Zywcu Zywiec SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				115.33 vs     73.74</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  55.91 vs     41.85</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 7.82 vs	1.91</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.43 vs	0.47</p>
<p>    financial costs			  2.61 vs	2.10</p>
<p>    investment				17.74 vs     14.77</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			30.58 vs	8.46</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  26.93 vs	5.98</p>
<p>    net profit				15.92 vs	3.12</p>
<p>    net sales				183.64 vs    117.48</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  92.20 vs     70.21</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 3.51 vs	2.86</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     2.25 vs	0.80</p>
<p>    financial costs			  5.86 vs	3.28</p>
<p>    investment				23.34 vs     28.76</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
